{"id":"3ac28e78a97bd5e3","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-quantifier-chain-compat.md","title":"quantifier-chain — Compatibility alias","display":"quantifier-chain — Compatibility alias","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-quantifier-chain-compat","aliases":["16-df-quantifier-chain-compat"],"display":"quantifier-chain — Compatibility alias","depends_on":["[[16-df-quantifier-chain]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-quantifier-chain-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-quantifier-chain-compat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"quantifier-chain — Compatibility alias"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5e50a47d180cbce\" href=\"?note=d5e50a47d180cbce\" title=\"16-df-quantifier-chain\">16-df-quantifier-chain</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为带所选有限积及提升选择的纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:I\\times J\\to I\">\\(\\pi:I\\times J\\to I\\)</span> 为投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QuantChain}_p(\\pi)\">\\(\\mathsf{QuantChain}_p(\\pi)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5e50a47d180cbce\" href=\"?note=d5e50a47d180cbce\" title=\"16-df-quantifier-chain\">16-df-quantifier-chain</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QuantChain}_p,\\mathsf{QuantChain}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_p\">\\(\\mathsf{QuantChain}_p,\\mathsf{QuantChain}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_p\\)</span> (谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}chain\\text{-}legacy}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{QuantChain}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_p(\\pi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{QuantChain}_p(\\pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}chain\\text{-}legacy}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{QuantChain}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_p(\\pi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{QuantChain}_p(\\pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>沿投影的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\dashv(-)^*\\dashv\\Pi\">\\(\\Sigma\\dashv(-)^*\\dashv\\Pi\\)</span> 定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d5e50a47d180cbce\" href=\"?note=d5e50a47d180cbce\" title=\"16-df-quantifier-chain\">16-df-quantifier-chain</a>；Beck–Chevalley 另由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a> 给出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-quantifier-chain","status":"resolved","id":"d5e50a47d180cbce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-quantifier-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-quantifier-chain","status":"resolved","id":"d5e50a47d180cbce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带所选有限积及提升选择的纤维化，$\\pi:I\\times J\\to I$ 为投影；$\\mathsf{QuantChain}_p(\\pi)$ 采用 [[16-df-quantifier-chain]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-quantifier-chain","status":"resolved","id":"d5e50a47d180cbce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]